Console (no window) back end: RISC OS keys, and two fixes.

- RISC OS: read keys with OS_Byte 129 (no termio); cursor keys are
  &8C-&8F. Sleep with usleep. FsChangeToProgramDir goes to <YSFlight$Dir>.
- FsCheckWindowOpen() was missing, so the game couldn't link with this
  back end; it returns 1. #include <string.h> for memset.

For YSCE ysce_public 1b13297. See docs/PORTING-NOTES.md in riscos-ysflight.

